  <PropertyGroup>
    <Guid>48647969-5e1b-493c-a191-61530c80fdbe</Guid>
    <Name>UniqueTraits</Name>
    <Description>Assign each rookie who is promoted naturally with XP (rather than as a result of a GTS, a mission, etc.) a unique trait that distinguishes them from every other soldier of the same class</Description>
